      en: ["Trás-os-Montes is the second-largest olive oil producing region in Portugal.", "Mirandela is at the heart of the region with DOP status since 1994.", "The Cobrançosa variety is the most widely cultivated olive here.", "Local olive oil is often cold-pressed to preserve its premium quality.", "Over 30,000 tons of olives are processed annually in the region.", "The Olive Oil Festival is held every year in February."],
